{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8000_place", "source_sha256": "7e86c711772f2b68a2ca64a5b483509a398ffe36fb0088ed2832ae65221a55a9", "ja": "闇の病院", "zh": "黑暗医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8001_p", "source_sha256": "94ae4317dce02982389d10a549cba6a8e2c7b9156f6f33372002bfe06ca027d6", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\nエミリーのテーマは、『闇ナース』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真特辑。\n艾米莉的主题是“黑暗护士”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8002_032emi", "source_sha256": "8927a715c4c3c42c971d2c89fa26d2f080603e3ac7904597853ffa2704564d28", "ja": "うう……幼き日に現れた背中の痕が疼いて……\nくっ……あ、頭が割れそうに痛い……！", "zh": "呜呜……幼年时浮现在背后的痕迹隐隐作痛……\n呃……头、头痛得像要裂开了一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8003_p", "source_sha256": "fffc0a8260b1e5a1321e89b7b5ec35010f03d62b9011031a4b5d5e3b7877b5c1", "ja": "エミリー！？　だ、大丈夫か！\n今すぐお医者さんを……！", "zh": "艾米莉！？你、你没事吧！\n我马上去找医生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8004_032emi", "source_sha256": "911eeb599c623bd2e1fe89bae207f8453f92541bef69ce62d5b11bbee856b4f6", "ja": "ああっ、仕掛け人さま！　違うんです！\n本当に具合が悪いわけではなくて……。", "zh": "啊，制作人先生！不是这样的！我真的不是身体不舒服，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8005_032emi", "source_sha256": "76285cbb56729c79a6dff167740fb349aad4abe65289daf1618da3526464e045", "ja": "闇の看護師さんを演じるとお聞きしたので、\n百合子さん直伝の想像訓練をしていたところなんです。", "zh": "听说要扮演暗之护士小姐，所以我正在做百合子小姐亲自传授的想象训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8006_p", "source_sha256": "cbf38b3204da70161f6f3fe529fa5667107284852ce4c80f95c72b90fb3dc54d", "ja": "な、なるほど……。確かにそれも悪くないが、\n念の為に他の案も考えてみようか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……确实那样也不错，不过为了以防万一，要不要也考虑一下其他方案？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8007", "source_sha256": "f6653c6793fe54c7f614b844668eb0a23c16385fbba4af604d99cbcbdca766fe", "ja": "依存心が強い", "zh": "依赖心很强", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8008", "source_sha256": "e9e416d2552af7af194548f16741e0d53240dd92a1e25883ae891565c1a7611a", "ja": "独占欲が強い", "zh": "占有欲很强", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8009", "source_sha256": "797bd805e44f27545ea6c3416e78e8e805a9dbc222541609e003a9ecd0d80e24", "ja": "闇が深い", "zh": "黑暗深不见底", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8100_p", "source_sha256": "4a5ae6edcb340f7366dabb995dee46b001c61841ae620100b4750c74320b852f", "ja": "相手のことを心配しすぎるあまり、いつも一緒にいて、\nお世話をしたがるナースをイメージしてみてくれ。", "zh": "请想象一下这样一位护士：因为太过担心对方，所以总是想和对方待在一起，还总想着照顾对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8101_032emi", "source_sha256": "7bd75e526df74a51b582c8384a453f6a112a381925cf5436f2217d01f22cfcb2", "ja": "……患者さんのことが大好きな看護師さん、ということ\nでしょうか？　わかりました。やってみます！", "zh": "……是非常喜欢患者的护士，对吧？明白了。我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8102_032emi", "source_sha256": "2376a81073d780bbe57ab7ee6b181e2e33382d7eea1f88a09990594aa8a22f51", "ja": "「私がお世話してあげますね。ずっとずーっと、\n永遠に♪」……役について、少しわかった気がします！", "zh": "“就由我来照顾你吧。一直一直，\n直到永远♪”……对于这个角色，我感觉稍微摸到一点门道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8200_p", "source_sha256": "f881aef82825863cdcda250d0dcdf3a099431b7a59c430b12d1179a3a4585bb6", "ja": "患者を自分だけのものにしたいと思っている\n独占欲の強いナースをイメージしてみてくれ。", "zh": "试着想象一下那种占有欲很强、\n想要把患者据为己有的护士吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8201_032emi", "source_sha256": "23454273b58000c2626bff4a904e3e4bdc93ec8e271e7602d1655af025b8a58d", "ja": "なるほど……？　変わった看護師さんなのですね。\nちょっと難しいですが、さっそく練習を……こほん。", "zh": "原来如此……？是位与众不同的护士呢。\n虽然有点难，不过马上就来练习……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8202_032emi", "source_sha256": "4c587f857eaf7c319005d780d8dda6dbd9c225816df4241a49ffebe0a2fe98dd", "ja": "「これを飲んだら、私のことしか考えられなく\nなりますよ♪」……えっと、こんな感じでしょうか？", "zh": "“喝下这个之后，就只能想着我了哦♪”……呃，大概是这种感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8300_p", "source_sha256": "66d989d6bf23708c7609d7bd196a3acb77ab443a7915d5a9c6bbeaa07f792580", "ja": "闇、すなわちダーク！　心に何かを抱えている\nナースをイメージしてみてくれ。", "zh": "黑暗，也就是Dark！试着想象一下，心中藏着某种心事的护士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8301_032emi", "source_sha256": "00abff1573747479970d2793fc36573b32db26155c6a121f03ce1805a1ab4e4b", "ja": "し、仕掛け人さまが、そうおっしゃるのでしたら……。\n心に何かを……う～ん……ううう～。", "zh": "既、既然制作人大人这么说……  \n心里藏着什么……唔嗯……唔唔唔～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_032emi_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_032emi_8302_032emi", "source_sha256": "23813e11554bd50c51c7aa55f9cd7b048892ef64e14d379049f2cfe64f4204da", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、私には難しすぎます……。\nもう少し、わかりやすく説明していただけますか？", "zh": "制作人，这对我来说太难了……\n可以请您再解释得简单易懂一些吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
